{"id":"word:hebrew:H4393","type":"word","title":"מְלֹא","subtitle":"H4393 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"fulness (literally or figuratively)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מְלֹא (H4393) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 38 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מְלֹא (mᵉlôʼ) means fulness (literally or figuratively) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 16 32."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מְלֹא","transliteration":"mᵉlôʼ","pronunciation":"mel-o'","strong":"H4393","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4393","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["מְלֹ֣א","מְלֹ֥א","וּ/מְלֹאָ֔/הּ","מְלֹֽא","מְלֹ֤א"],"morphs":[["HNcmsc",17],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp3fs",11],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp3ms",4],["HC/Ncmsc",2],["HR/Ncmsc/Sp3fs",2],["HR/Ncmsc",1],["HNcmsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"fulness (literally or figuratively)","usage":"× all along, × all that is (there-) in, fill, (× that whereof...was) full, fulness, (hand-) full, multitude.","full":"H4393. melo מְלֹא , [ מְלוֺא ] noun masculine Isaiah 8 Isa 1:4 fulness, that which fills (Arabic Lane 2729 ); — ׳מ construct Gen 48:19 19 t.; מְלוֺ Ezek 41:8 ; suffix מְלוֺאוֺ Isa 42:10 3 t.; מְלוֺאָהּ Deut 33:16 12 t.; — 1 fulness of hand (= handful) Eccl 4:6 (twice in verse) followed by accusative of material ׳מ מִּיחַ חָפְנֵיכֶם Exod 9:8 compare Lev 16:12 ; 1Kin 17:12 ; so homer-full of manna; Exod 16:33 compare Lev 16:12 ; Num 22:18 ; 24:13 ; Judg 6:38 ; simil. בְגְדוֺ מְלֹא 2Kin 4:39 ; rarely followed by מִן Lev 2:2 ; 5:12 , compare Exod 16:32 (but read perhaps מִלְאוּ so ⅏ ᵐ5 see Di). 2 mass of shepherds Isa 31:4 (in sim); multitude of nations Gen 48:19 (compare Arabic Qor 2:247 and elsewhere) 3 fullness = that which fills, entire contents , of אֶרֶץ Deut 33:16 ; Psa 24:1 ; Isa 6:3 ; 8:8 ; 34:1 ; Micah 1:2 ; Jer 8:16 ; 47:2 ; Ezek 12:19 ; 19:7 ; 30:12 ; 32:15 ; תֵּבֵל Psa 50:12 ; 89:12 ; יָם Isa 42:10 ; 1Chr 16:32 ; Psa 96:11 ; 98:7 ; עִיר Amos 6:8 . 4 phrases: — ׳מ קוֺמָתוֺ = at full length 1Sam 28:20 ; full line , or portion ׳מ הַחֶ֫בַל 2Sam 8:2 ; ׳מ הַקָּנֶה Ezek 41:8 full rod (reed).","rootNote":"rarely מְלוֹא ; or מְלוֹ ; (Ezekiel 41:8), from 4390 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 16 32","keyReferences":["1Chr 16 32","1Kgs 17 12","1Sam 28 20","2Kgs 4 39","2Sam 8 2","Amos 6 8","Deut 33 16","Eccl 4 6"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":38,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 16 32","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":32,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מְלוֹא֔/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 17 12","book":"1Kgs","chapter":17,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מְלֹ֤א","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Sam 28 20","book":"1Sam","chapter":28,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מְלֹא","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"2Kgs 4 39","book":"2Kgs","chapter":4,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מְלֹ֣א","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"2Sam 8 2","book":"2Sam","chapter":8,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מְלֹ֥א","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Amos 6 8","book":"Amos","chapter":6,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מְלֹאָֽ/הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"Deut 33 16","book":"Deut","chapter":33,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מְלֹאָ֔/הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"Eccl 4 6","book":"Eccl","chapter":4,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מְלֹ֥א","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Eccl 4 6","book":"Eccl","chapter":4,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִ/מְּלֹ֥א","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Exod 9 8","book":"Exod","chapter":9,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מְלֹ֣א","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"